async function deleteFashion(id){if(!await confirmModal('删除皮肤',`确定删除皮肤 ${id}（${localizedName('fashions',id)||'未找到名称'}）？`,'删除',true))return;try{await api(serverPath(`players/${state.player}/fashions/${id}`),{method:'DELETE'});await refreshPlayer('皮肤已删除；客户端将在下次同步刷新')}catch(e){toast(e.message,true)}}
async function editProgress(){const p=state.data.progress,stageOptions=await resourceOptions('stages'),options=[{value:'0',label:'0 · 未设置 · 关卡',search:'0 未设置 关卡'},...stageOptions],v=await showModal({title:'修改当前进度',fields:[{name:'current_stage_id',label:'当前关卡 ID',type:'search-select',value:p.current_stage_id||0,options,required:true},{name:'mainline_choose_stage_id',label:'主线选择关卡 ID',type:'search-select',value:p.mainline_choose_stage_id||0,options,required:true}]});if(!v)return;try{await api(serverPath(`players/${state.player}/progress`),{method:'PUT',body:JSON.stringify({current_stage_id:Number(v.current_stage_id),mainline_choose_stage_id:Number(v.mainline_choose_stage_id)})});await refreshPlayer('进度已保存；无独立推送的字段将在下次 Sync 刷新')}catch(e){toast(e.message,true)}}
async function editStage(id){const old=state.data.stages.find(x=>x.stage_id===id)||{},options=await resourceOptions('stages',id),v=await showModal({title:id?'编辑关卡':'添加关卡',fields:[{name:'stage_id',label:'关卡 ID',type:'search-select',value:id||'',options,required:true,readonly:!!id},{name:'state',label:'状态',type:'number',value:old.state??3,min:0,step:1,required:true},{name:'star',label:'星数',type:'number',value:old.star??3,min:0,step:1,required:true},{name:'reward',label:'奖励状态',type:'number',value:old.reward??1,min:0,step:1,required:true}]});if(!v)return;const stage_id=Number(v.stage_id);try{const r=await api(serverPath(`players/${state.player}/stages/${stage_id}`),{method:'PUT',body:JSON.stringify({state:Number(v.state),star:Number(v.star),show_star:Number(v.star),reward:Number(v.reward)})});await refreshPlayer(`关卡已更新，实时通知 ${r.notified} 个会话`)}catch(e){toast(e.message,true)}}
async function editGuide(id){const old=state.data.guides.find(x=>x.group_id===id)||{},options=await resourceOptions('guides',id),v=await showModal({title:id?'编辑引导':'添加引导',fields:[{name:'group_id',label:'引导组 ID',type:'search-select',value:id||'',options,required:true,readonly:!!id},{name:'step_id',label:'步骤 ID',type:'number',value:old.step_id??0,min:0,step:1,required:true},{name:'status',label:'状态',type:'number',value:old.status??1,min:0,step:1,required:true}]});if(!v)return;const group_id=Number(v.group_id);try{const r=await api(serverPath(`players/${state.player}/guides/${group_id}`),{method:'PUT',body:JSON.stringify({step_id:Number(v.step_id),status:Number(v.status)})});await refreshPlayer(`引导已更新，实时通知 ${r.notified} 个会话`)}catch(e){toast(e.message,true)}}
async function editUnlock(id){const old=state.data.unlocks.find(x=>x.unlock_id===id)||{},options=await resourceOptions('unlocks',id),v=await showModal({title:id?'编辑系统解锁':'添加系统解锁',fields:[{name:'id',label:'系统解锁 ID',type:'search-select',value:id||'',options,required:true,readonly:!!id},{name:'is_read',label:'已读',type:'checkbox',value:!!old.is_read}]});if(!v)return;id=Number(v.id);try{const r=await api(serverPath(`players/${state.player}/unlocks/${id}`),{method:'PUT',body:JSON.stringify({is_read:v.is_read})});await refreshPlayer(`解锁已更新，实时通知 ${r.notified} 个会话`)}catch(e){toast(e.message,true)}}
async function editRoleLove(id){const old=state.data.role_love.find(x=>x.role_id===id)||{},options=await resourceOptions('roles',id),v=await showModal({title:id?'编辑男主羁绊':'添加男主羁绊',fields:[{name:'id',label:'男主角色 ID',type:'search-select',value:id||'',options,required:true,readonly:!!id},{name:'love_level',label:'羁绊等级',type:'number',value:old.love_level??1,min:1,step:1,required:true},{name:'love_point',label:'羁绊值',type:'number',value:old.love_point??0,min:0,step:1,required:true}]});if(!v)return;id=Number(v.id);try{const r=await api(serverPath(`players/${state.player}/role-love/${id}`),{method:'PUT',body:JSON.stringify({love_level:Number(v.love_level),love_point:Number(v.love_point)})});await refreshPlayer(`羁绊已更新，实时通知 ${r.notified} 个会话`)}catch(e){toast(e.message,true)}}
async function deleteState(section,key){if(!await confirmModal('删除状态记录',`确定删除 ${section}:${key}？`,'删除',true))return;try{await api(serverPath(`players/${state.player}/${section}/${key}`),{method:'DELETE'});await refreshPlayer('状态已删除；客户端将在下次同步校正删除结果')}catch(e){toast(e.message,true)}}
async function editTask(id){const old=state.data.tasks.find(x=>x.task_id===id)||{},options=await resourceOptions('tasks',id),v=await showModal({title:id?'编辑任务':'添加任务',fields:[{name:'id',label:'任务 ID',type:'search-select',value:id||'',options,required:true,readonly:!!id},{name:'num',label:'进度',type:'number',value:old.num||0,min:0,step:1,required:true},{name:'reward_count',label:'领奖次数',type:'number',value:old.reward_count||0,min:0,step:1,required:true}]});if(!v)return;id=Number(v.id);try{const r=await api(serverPath(`players/${state.player}/tasks/${id}`),{method:'PUT',body:JSON.stringify({num:Number(v.num),reward_count:Number(v.reward_count),complete_time:old.complete_time||0,has_got_next:!!old.has_got_next})});await refreshPlayer(`任务已更新，实时通知 ${r.notified} 个会话`)}catch(e){toast(e.message,true)}}
$('#uid-sequence').onclick=async()=>{try{const current=await api(serverPath('players-sequence')),v=await showModal({title:'修改 UID 自增序列',message:'仅影响以后自动创建的角色，不会改变现有 UID。',fields:[{name:'next_account_id',label:'下一个自动分配的 UID',type:'number',value:current.next_account_id,min:1,step:1,required:true}],submitText:'保存序列'});if(!v)return;await api(serverPath('players-sequence'),{method:'PUT',body:JSON.stringify({next_account_id:Number(v.next_account_id)})});toast(`下一个自动 UID 已设为 ${v.next_account_id}`)}catch(e){toast(e.message,true)}};
$('#new-player').onclick=async()=>{try{const options=await accountOptions(),v=await showModal({title:'新建角色',message:'UID 和 OpenID 均可留空；留空 UID 将使用自增序列，未绑定 OpenID 的角色暂时不可登录。',fields:[{name:'account_id',label:'自定义 UID（留空自动分配）',type:'number',min:1,step:1},{name:'openid',label:'SDK OpenID（可留空）',type:'search-select',options},{name:'zone_id',label:'Zone ID',type:'search-select',value:1,options:[{value:1,label:'1 · 默认区服 · Zone',search:'1 默认区服 Zone'}],required:true}],submitText:'创建角色'});if(!v)return;const r=await api(serverPath('players'),{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({account_id:Number(v.account_id)||0,openid:v.openid||'',zone_id:Number(v.zone_id)})});toast('角色已创建');await loadPlayers();selectPlayer(r.player.account_id)}catch(e){toast(e.message,true)}};
$('#account-search').onclick=loadAccounts;$('#account-query').onkeydown=e=>{if(e.key==='Enter')loadAccounts()};
async function loadAccounts(){try{const d=await api('sdk/accounts?q='+encodeURIComponent($('#account-query').value));$('#account-list').innerHTML=table(['ID / OpenID','手机号','账号状态','安全状态','创建时间','上次登录','操作'],d.accounts.map(a=>{const phone=String(a.phone||'').split('#deleted#')[0],deleted=!!a.deleted_at,safe=!!a.is_safe,automatic=a.security_override===null;return `<tr><td>${a.id}</td><td>${esc(phone)}</td><td><span class="pill status-tag ${deleted?'danger':'ok'}">${deleted?'已注销':'正常'}</span></td><td><span class="pill status-tag ${safe?'ok':'warning'}">${safe?'安全':'不安全'}</span>${!safe&&automatic?'<small class="muted"> 14 天保护期</small>':''}</td><td>${localTime(a.created_at)}</td><td>${localTime(a.last_login_at)}</td><td>${deleted?`<button class="small ok" data-restoreaccount="${a.id}" data-phone="${esc(phone)}">恢复账号</button>`:`<button class="small" data-editaccount="${a.id}" data-phone="${esc(phone)}" data-safe="${safe}">编辑账号</button> <button class="small" data-password="${a.id}">修改密码</button> <button class="small danger" data-logoutall="${a.id}">登出全部设备</button> <button class="small warning" data-delaccount="${a.id}">软注销</button>`} <button class="small danger" data-harddelaccount="${a.id}">硬删除</button></td></tr>`}));
$$('[data-editaccount]').forEach(x=>x.onclick=()=>editAccount(x.dataset.editaccount,x.dataset.phone,x.dataset.safe==='true'));$$('[data-password]').forEach(x=>x.onclick=()=>changePassword(x.dataset.password));$$('[data-logoutall]').forEach(x=>x.onclick=()=>logoutAllDevices(x.dataset.logoutall));$$('[data-delaccount]').forEach(x=>x.onclick=()=>deleteAccount(x.dataset.delaccount));$$('[data-restoreaccount]').forEach(x=>x.onclick=()=>restoreAccount(x.dataset.restoreaccount,x.dataset.phone));$$('[data-harddelaccount]').forEach(x=>x.onclick=()=>hardDeleteAccount(x.dataset.harddelaccount))}catch(e){toast(e.message,true)}}
$('#new-account').onclick=async()=>{const v=await showModal({title:'新建 SDK 账号',fields:[{name:'phone',label:'中国大陆手机号',autocomplete:'tel',required:true},{name:'password',label:'初始密码（可留空）',type:'password',autocomplete:'new-password'}],submitText:'创建账号'});if(!v)return;try{await api('sdk/accounts',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({phone:v.phone,password:v.password})});toast('SDK 账号已创建');loadAccounts()}catch(e){toast(e.message,true)}};
async function editAccount(id,phone,isSafe){const v=await showModal({title:'编辑 SDK 账号',message:'手机号或密码发生变更后，账号会自动进入 14 天不安全保护期；你也可以在这里人工覆盖当前安全状态。',fields:[{name:'phone',label:'手机号',value:phone,autocomplete:'tel',required:true},{name:'is_safe',label:'标记为安全账号',type:'checkbox',value:isSafe}],submitText:'保存账号'});if(!v)return;const body={phone:v.phone};if(v.is_safe!==isSafe)body.is_safe=v.is_safe;try{await api(`sdk/accounts/${id}`,{method:'PATCH',body:JSON.stringify(body)});toast('账号信息已更新');loadAccounts()}catch(e){toast(e.message,true)}}
async function changePassword(id){const v=await showModal({title:'修改账号密码',message:'已有密码被修改后，账号会自动进入 14 天不安全保护期；首次设置密码不受影响。',fields:[{name:'password',label:'新密码（至少 6 位）',type:'password',autocomplete:'new-password',minlength:6,required:true},{name:'confirmation',label:'再次输入新密码',type:'password',autocomplete:'new-password',minlength:6,required:true}],submitText:'修改密码'});if(!v)return;if(v.password!==v.confirmation)return toast('两次输入的密码不一致',true);try{await api(`sdk/accounts/${id}/password`,{method:'PUT',body:JSON.stringify({password:v.password})});toast('密码已修改');loadAccounts()}catch(e){toast(e.message,true)}}
async function logoutAllDevices(id){if(!await confirmModal('登出全部设备','撤销该账号当前全部 SDK 登录令牌？所有设备下次鉴权时都需要重新登录。','全部登出',true))return;try{await api(`sdk/accounts/${id}/logout-all`,{method:'POST',body:'{}'});toast('全部设备的登录令牌已撤销')}catch(e){toast(e.message,true)}}
async function deleteAccount(id){if(!await confirmModal('软注销 SDK 账号','将撤销全部登录令牌；BOOI 会解绑并软注销该 OpenID 下的角色。账号与角色数据永久保留，可由管理台恢复。','软注销账号',true))return;try{await api(`sdk/accounts/${id}`,{method:'DELETE'});toast('SDK 账号已软注销');loadAccounts()}catch(e){toast(e.message,true)}}
async function restoreAccount(id,phone){const v=await showModal({title:'恢复 SDK 账号',message:'取消注销后可重新登录；如原手机号已被占用，请填写新的手机号。',fields:[{name:'phone',label:'恢复使用的手机号',value:phone,autocomplete:'tel',required:true}],submitText:'恢复账号'});if(!v)return;try{await api(`sdk/accounts/${id}/restore`,{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({phone:v.phone})});toast('SDK 账号已恢复');loadAccounts()}catch(e){toast(e.message,true)}}
async function hardDeleteAccount(id){const v=await showModal({title:'永久删除 SDK 账号',message:`彻底删除 OpenID ${id} 及其 SDK 会话，无法恢复。应先确认 BOOI 角色已解绑或删除。请输入该 OpenID 确认。`,fields:[{name:'confirmation',label:'输入 OpenID 确认',required:true}],submitText:'永久删除',danger:true});if(!v)return;if(v.confirmation!==String(id))return toast('输入的 OpenID 不匹配，未执行删除',true);try{await api(`sdk/accounts/${id}/hard`,{method:'DELETE'});toast(`SDK 账号 ${id} 已永久删除`);loadAccounts()}catch(e){toast(e.message,true)}}
$('#report-search').onclick=()=>{reportState.query=$('#report-query').value.trim();reportState.offset=0;loadReports()};
$('#report-query').onkeydown=e=>{if(e.key==='Enter')$('#report-search').click()};
$('#report-refresh').onclick=()=>loadReports();
async function loadReports(){const list=$('#report-list'),summary=$('#report-summary'),pagination=$('#report-pagination');list.setAttribute('aria-busy','true');summary.textContent='正在读取举报历史…';try{const d=await api(`sdk/reports?q=${encodeURIComponent(reportState.query)}&limit=${reportState.limit}&offset=${reportState.offset}`);reportState.total=Number(d.total)||0;const reports=d.reports||[],from=reportState.total?reportState.offset+1:0,to=Math.min(reportState.offset+reports.length,reportState.total);summary.textContent=reportState.query?`找到 ${reportState.total} 条匹配记录，当前显示 ${from}–${to} 条`:`共 ${reportState.total} 条举报记录，当前显示 ${from}–${to} 条`;if(!reports.length){list.innerHTML=`<div class="empty report-empty">${reportState.query?'没有匹配的举报记录':'尚无举报记录'}</div>`}else{list.innerHTML=table(['接收时间','举报人','被举报人','原因','举报内容','环境信息','请求 ID'],reports.map(r=>`<tr><td><span class="report-time">${localTime(r.created_at)}</span>${r.event_timestamp?`<small>客户端 ${localTime(r.event_timestamp)}</small>`:''}</td><td>${reportPerson(r.submitter_role_name,r.submitter_role_id)}</td><td>${reportPerson(r.violation_role_name,r.violation_role_id)}</td><td><span class="pill status-tag warning">${esc(r.reason_name||'未知原因')} (${r.reason_id||'-'})</span></td><td class="report-content">${esc(r.content||'—')}</td><td><span class="report-meta">Zone ${r.zone_id||'-'} · Region ${r.region||'-'}</span><small>来源 ${esc(r.source_name||'未知')} (${r.source||'-'}) · 平台 ${esc(r.platform_name||'未知')} (${r.platform||'-'}) · IP ${esc(r.observed_ip||'-')}</small></td><td><span class="mono report-request-id" title="${esc(r.request_id)}">${esc(r.request_id)}</span><small>${esc(r.host||'-')}</small></td></tr>`))}renderReportPagination();list.setAttribute('aria-busy','false')}catch(e){list.setAttribute('aria-busy','false');summary.textContent='举报历史加载失败';list.innerHTML='<div class="empty report-empty">加载失败，请点击“刷新记录”重试</div>';pagination.replaceChildren();toast(e.message,true)}}
function reportPerson(name,id){return `<span class="report-person"><strong>${esc(name||'未命名')}</strong><small>#${esc(id||'-')}</small></span>`}
function renderReportPagination(){const container=$('#report-pagination'),page=Math.floor(reportState.offset/reportState.limit)+1,pages=Math.max(1,Math.ceil(reportState.total/reportState.limit));if(reportState.total<=reportState.limit){container.replaceChildren();return}container.innerHTML=`<div class="table-pager report-pager"><span>第 ${page}/${pages} 页 · 每页 ${reportState.limit} 条</span><div><button id="report-prev" class="small" type="button" ${reportState.offset===0?'disabled':''}>上一页</button> <button id="report-next" class="small" type="button" ${reportState.offset+reportState.limit>=reportState.total?'disabled':''}>下一页</button></div></div>`;$('#report-prev').onclick=()=>{reportState.offset=Math.max(0,reportState.offset-reportState.limit);loadReports()};$('#report-next').onclick=()=>{reportState.offset+=reportState.limit;loadReports()}}
$('#catalog-search').onclick=loadCatalog;$('#catalog-query').onkeydown=e=>{if(e.key==='Enter')loadCatalog()};
async function loadCatalog(){if(!state.server)return;const kind=$('#catalog-kind').value,q=$('#catalog-query').value;try{const d=await api(serverPath(`catalog/${kind}?q=${encodeURIComponent(q)}&limit=300`));$('#catalog-list').innerHTML=`<div class="cards">${d.rows.map(row=>`<div class="resource"><small>${esc(kind)}</small><b title="${esc(row.localized_name||'未找到本地化名')}">${esc(row.localized_name||'未找到本地化名')}</b><span class="id">${esc(row.id)} · Text ${row.name_text_id||'-'}</span><footer>${catalogAction(kind,row.id,row.asset_type)}</footer></div>`).join('')}</div>`;$$('[data-grantcard]').forEach(x=>x.onclick=()=>withPlayer(()=>editCard(Number(x.dataset.grantcard))));$$('[data-grantfashion]').forEach(x=>x.onclick=()=>withPlayer(()=>addFashion(Number(x.dataset.grantfashion))));$$('[data-grantitem]').forEach(x=>x.onclick=()=>withPlayer(()=>editAsset(Number(x.dataset.type||0),Number(x.dataset.grantitem),0)));$$('[data-grantstage]').forEach(x=>x.onclick=()=>withPlayer(()=>editStage(Number(x.dataset.grantstage))));$$('[data-granttask]').forEach(x=>x.onclick=()=>withPlayer(()=>editTask(Number(x.dataset.granttask))));$$('[data-grantunlock]').forEach(x=>x.onclick=()=>withPlayer(()=>editUnlock(Number(x.dataset.grantunlock))));$$('[data-grantguide]').forEach(x=>x.onclick=()=>withPlayer(()=>editGuide(Number(x.dataset.grantguide))))}catch(e){toast(e.message,true)}}
function withPlayer(action){if(!state.player)return toast('请先选择玩家',true);action()}
function catalogAction(kind,id,type){if(kind==='cards')return `<button class="small primary" data-grantcard="${id}">发放</button>`;if(kind==='fashions')return `<button class="small primary" data-grantfashion="${id}">发放</button>`;if(kind==='items')return `<button class="small primary" data-type="${type||0}" data-grantitem="${id}">设置数量</button>`;if(kind==='stages')return `<button class="small primary" data-grantstage="${id}">设置</button>`;if(kind==='tasks')return `<button class="small primary" data-granttask="${id}">设置</button>`;if(kind==='unlocks')return `<button class="small primary" data-grantunlock="${id}">解锁</button>`;if(kind==='guides')return `<button class="small primary" data-grantguide="${id}">设置</button>`;return ''}
$('#catalog-kind').onchange=loadCatalog;
boot();
